elvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">微信支付发布AI接入工具箱2.0版本，支持9种语言并降低50% Token消耗</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI投入1.5亿美元构建合作伙伴网络，加速企业级AI落地应用</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Meta在Facebook推出AI模式搜索功能，整合全平台公开数据实现智能问答</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯领投2000万美元加持林俊旸新AI实验室，投后估值达20亿美元</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/0f4300690cd50684397f89db68d9d269.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">原阿里巴巴通义千问大模型负责人林俊旸创立的新AI实验室完成首轮融资，腾讯投入2000万美元。本轮融资总额达数亿美元，投后估值约20亿美元，高榕资本与红杉中国各出资1亿美元领投。林俊旸曾任阿里最年轻P10级技术专家，与杨植麟、唐杰、姚顺雨并称“基模四杰”，于今年3月离职创业。目前该实验室具体技术路线尚未公开，但凭借林俊旸在基础模型领域的深厚积累，市场对其研发进展保持高度关注。此次注资反映了互联网大厂通过押注顶级技术人才，抢先锁定大模型领域核心竞争力的战略布局。随着资金到位，该实验室已启动新一轮融资筹备，其后续研发动向及首款产品落地将成为行业焦点。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">稀宇科技正式开源多模态旗舰模型MiniMax M3，推理速度提升至80 TPS</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/be3c1e6daf5cfdf2bb3780fa1e345b3d.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">稀宇科技今日正式开源其原生多模态旗舰大模型MiniMax M3。该模型拥有428B总参数量，激活参数为23B，是行业首个从底层训练初期即进行多模态混合训练的开源模型。发布两周内，M3已登顶全球综合智能指数排行榜开源模型榜首。针对此前访问量激增导致的延迟，官方已将模型输出速度从30 TPS优化至80 TPS，并承诺未来持续提速。在技术表现上，M3展现了顶尖的编码与智能体能力，支持复杂任务拆解及多步推理，其输出的代码旨在达到直接交付标准，旨在显著提升开发者的生产力。此前，MiniMax已向业界开放模型权重并发布了稀疏注意力机制论文，此次全面开源将进一步推动开源社区的多模态技术应用与生态建设。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微信支付发布AI接入工具箱2.0版本，支持9种语言并降低50% Token消耗</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/857ec30a9117537cf3dbab1458ed4c82.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">微信支付正式发布AI接入工具箱2.0版本，在安全、高效与原生流畅度方面实现重大升级。该版本全面支持中、英、日等9种语言，并针对微信支付业务概念进行原生语义适配，消除翻译偏差。知识库已覆盖微信支付全品类，并新增技术专家与金融级研发专家AI能力，支持场景选型、故障排查及金融级代码安全审查。为提升开发效率，新版本引入CLI动态排障功能，开发者可通过自然语言实时查询支付与退款状态。此外，官方将文档中的时序图与状态图统一转为Mermaid格式，适配大模型读取，使Token消耗相比原始HTML文档降低50%。此次更新旨在通过技术优化，帮助全球开发者更高效、低成本地完成微信支付对接工作。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI投入1.5亿美元构建合作伙伴网络，加速企业级AI落地应用</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/40228632a3893ece841b3cb4f05c2fbb.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI正式发布“OpenAI合作伙伴网络”并投入1.5亿美元资金，旨在通过生态共建加速AI解决方案在企业端的规模化应用。该计划通过与系统集成商、咨询公司及技术服务商合作，解决企业在AI转型中面临的用例定义、工作流程重构及系统集成难题。合作伙伴体系划分为Select、Advanced和Elite三个层级，并启动“前沿部署专家”试点计划，派遣工程团队协助复杂项目落地。该网络覆盖Codex、网络安全及AI智能体等领域，目标在2026年底前培训30万名认证顾问。目前，Paychex、eBay及安捷伦等企业已通过该生态实现业务流程智能化升级，其中Paychex薪酬管理流程的等待时间缩短80%，人工审核效率提升30%。此举标志着OpenAI正通过生态驱动模式，将前沿模型技术深度渗透至全球商业运营的各个垂直领域。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Meta在Facebook推出AI模式搜索功能，整合全平台公开数据实现智能问答</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/42dbdc0a3601a48b39e1e771fac576ec.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Meta正式在Facebook平台上线“AI模式”（AI Mode）搜索功能，通过生成式AI技术直接从Facebook群组、Reels短视频等全平台公开帖子中提取信息，为用户提供自然语言交互的综合文本答案。该功能旨在改变传统滚动式搜索体验，利用海量UGC内容进行AI摘要。除搜索升级外，Meta近期密集布局AI矩阵，包括新增视频拼贴与转场AI编辑工具、个人资料页AI“衣橱”功能，以及此前推出的Marketplace自动代回复工具和创作者个性化AI助手。这一系列动作旨在提升平台粘性与实用性，并配合Meta全球多平台订阅计划，为未来推出深度绑定AI的高阶订阅套餐蓄势。尽管该模式提升了信息获取效率，但市场对其信息准确性与时效性风险仍存担忧。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
